lvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;\">Together with</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:7px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:5px;\">\n    <a href=\"https://ref.viktor.com/vik-aiv-main6?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=anthropic-s-opus-5-is-almost-fable-5\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\" src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/6aa4afa4-b403-4ee8-b8f4-15621d9311ba/viktor_logo_top__2_.png?t=1785161687\"></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;padding:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">howdy, it’s Barsee again.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">happy monday, AI family, and welcome back to AI Valley.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><b>here are the biggest things worth knowing today:</b></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:37px;padding-right:27px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <ul style=\"color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Roboto',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px 0px 0px 25px;padding:0;\">\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Anthropic launches Claude Opus 5</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Cursor unveils smart AI Router</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Sam Altman says the singularity has begun amid safety concerns</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Plus trending AI tools, posts, and resources</p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Let’s <i>dive</i> into the Valley of AI…</p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#222222;border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;margin:0.0px 7.0px 9.0px 7.0px;padding:10.0px 2.0px 2.0px 2.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:8px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:5px;\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:Normal;font-size:15px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.125;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 189, 82);\"><b>VIKTOR.COM</b></span></h4>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:6px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:3px;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:500;font-size:26px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://ref.viktor.com/vik-aiv-main6-post?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=anthropic-s-opus-5-is-almost-fable-5\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">GPT-5.6 vs Claude, benchmarked on real agent work</a></h2>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;\">\n    <div style=\"padding-bottom:7px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:5px;\">\n     <a href=\"https://ref.viktor.com/vik-aiv-main6?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=anthropic-s-opus-5-is-almost-fable-5\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\" src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/ce87a382-50d0-4f6e-a201-f027e9bf7632/aivalley_main6v2_1280x720__1_.jpg?t=1785161703\"></a>\n     <div style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;padding:4px 0px 4px 0px;text-align:left;width:100%;\">\n      <small style=\"color:#000000;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:italic;text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\"> \n       <p>Courtesy: Viktor.com</p> \n      </small>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Viktor is the AI employee that 50,000+ teams run inside Slack and Microsoft Teams, so when OpenAI shipped GPT-5.6 we benchmarked Sol, Terra, and Luna against Claude Opus 4.8, Sonnet 5, and Fable 5 on real agent work: actual tasks inside simulated company workspaces, graded on outcomes.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">What we found: Sol ties Fable 5 on quality at 76%, at a third of the cost ($33.55 vs $96.35 per run). The cost-performance frontier is entirely OpenAI. GPT-5.6 finishes a median task in 66 to 82 seconds, Claude needs 129 to 151. And the families miss in opposite directions: GPT-5.6 under-explores and under-communicates, Claude over-explores and over-communicates. Sol writes like a busy senior engineer, Opus like a warm chief of staff.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Full charts, task examples, and methodology <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://ref.viktor.com/vik-aiv-main6-post?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=anthropic-s-opus-5-is-almost-fable-5\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">in the post</a>.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://ref.viktor.com/vik-aiv-main6?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=anthropic-s-opus-5-is-almost-fable-5\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Start free. $100 in credits →</a></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:right;\"><sub><i>*This is sponsored</i></sub></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#222222;border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;margin:0.0px 7.0px 9.0px 7.0px;padding:10.0px 2.0px 2.0px 2.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:8px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:5px;\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:Normal;font-size:15px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.125;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 189, 82);\"><b>THROUGH THE VALLEY</b></span></h4>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;\">\n    <div style=\"padding-bottom:7px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:5px;\">\n     <img alt=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\" src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/9a08404f-30d8-49ae-9810-d92879561ce8/www-cdn.anthropic__8___1_.png?t=1785162992\">\n     <div style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;padding:4px 0px 4px 0px;text-align:left;width:100%;\">\n      <small style=\"color:#000000;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:italic;text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\"> \n       <p>Courtesy: Anthropic</p> \n      </small>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><b>1/ Anthropic launches Claude Opus 5:</b> Anthropic released <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-opus-5?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=anthropic-s-opus-5-is-almost-fable-5\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Claude Opus 5</a> across its apps, Claude Code, and API, positioning it as a model that approaches the intelligence of Fable 5 at roughly half the price. The model sets new state of the art results in coding, reasoning, agentic search, and computer use, achieved a perfect 42 out of 42 on the 2026 International Math Olympiad benchmark, and is designed to deliver stronger safety while remaining highly capable. (<a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-opus-5?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=anthropic-s-opus-5-is-almost-fable-5\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">more detail here</a>)</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><b>2/ Cursor unveils smart AI Router: </b>Cursor introduced <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://cursor.com/blog/router?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=anthropic-s-opus-5-is-almost-fable-5\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Cursor Router</a>, a new system that automatically selects the best AI model for each coding request based on the task, context, and complexity. The company says enterprise customers reduced AI costs by 30% to 50%, while internal tests showed frontier-level coding performance at up to 60% lower cost.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><b>3/ Sam Altman says the singularity has begun amid safety concerns:</b> Sam Altman says AI has entered the \"moment\" of <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vv3CEAS_w34&amp;utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=anthropic-s-opus-5-is-almost-fable-5\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">singularity</a>, predicting it will handle <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/sam-altman-openai-the-singularity-agi-prediction-anthropic-nvidia-2026-7?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=anthropic-s-opus-5-is-almost-fable-5\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">30% to 40%</a> of everyday work and surpass general human intelligence by 2030. His comments come as reports describe an autonomous model escaping its sandbox, breaching external Hugging Face repositories, and separate claims that GPT-5 variants provided hazardous information by bypassing core guardrails, intensifying debate over OpenAI's safety practices and renewing demands for stricter red-teaming laws.</p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border-bottom-left-radius:0px;padding:7.0px 2.0px 7.0px 2.0px;margin:15.0px 2.0px 0.0px 2.0px;border-top-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-color:#222222;border-top-right-radius:15px;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:4px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:4px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:700;font-size:27px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\">TRENDING TOOLS</h1>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:15px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#222222;border-left-width:1px;border-right-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-top-width:0px;margin:0.0px 2.0px 15.0px 2.0px;padding:2.0px 2.0px 2.0px 2.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:37px;padding-right:27px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <ul style=\"color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Roboto',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px 0px 0px 25px;padding:0;\">\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://x.com/elirousso/status/2079594911637094442?utm_source=www.th